        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John McTiernan, Michael Nyqvist, Rene Russo, Denis Leary, Greg Callaghan\n- Works: The Thomas Crown Affair, Gregor and the Code of Claw\n- Roles: director, actor, audiobook narrator\n\nFacts:\n- John McTiernan directed the 1999 American heist film The Thomas Crown Affair.\n- The Thomas Crown Affair stars Michael Nyqvist, Rene Russo, and Denis Leary.\n- Greg Callaghan read the audiobook of Gregor and the Code of Claw, which was released in 2008.\n- Greg Callaghan also appeared in The Thomas Crown Affair.",
